{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "But if I work at a club like this, I can earn a lot in no time at all. That is, as long as I can put up with it...": "",
  "I see. So that's what's going on.": "",
  "Yeah. A lot of college girls end up working in sex shops, you know.": "",
  "But since I don't want to actually... give myself to men that way, I chose to work here instead.": "",
  "Geez. It's a shame that society has put some of you girls in such a tough position.": "",
  "Haha, you really think so? You're weird. But you know what? I actually kinda like you. You're nice to talk to.": "",
  "Hmm, you sure that's not just sales talk?": "",
  "Of course not! Don't be rude. And besides, you know I'm not that good at talking.": "",
  "You sure about that? If you talked to other customers the way you did just now, I bet a lot of them would be happy.": "",
  "Hah, I'll keep that in mind.": "",
  "Did you enjoy your time with Madoka-chan? I hope she didn't offend you in any way.": "",
  "Oh, she was fantastic. I'll definitely be back.": "",
  "I gotta say, it really is shocking to see Madoka enjoying her time with a customer. She's never like that.": "",
  "Yeah. Like, the other day, she was so quiet, a customer thought she was a foreigner who couldn't speak Japanese!": "",
  "Haha, is that right?": "",
  "Yup. It's the first time I've seen her engage in a normal conversation like this. You must be a pretty smooth dude.": "",
  "Madoka's pretty... different from the other girls, but she's a keeper. So if you like her, be good to her, okay?": "",
  "I'll be sure to.": "",
  "(Well, better report back to Yosuke-san. I'm sure he'll have a thing or two to say.)": "",
  "Excuse me, is Madoka-chan here?": "",
  "Ah, you're the gentleman from before. Yes, she's available.": "",
  "Great, then I'd like to go with her, please.": "",
  "Hey, you came back!": "",
  "Of course. I could hardly finish my drinks last time.": "",
  "Then let's take it nice and slow today, hmm? ❤": "",
  "(I'm gonna drink a lot— at least I'll contribute to her sales.)": "",
  "Yes, I'll take Madonkadonk, please. Er, I mean Madoka-chan.": "",
  "You sure like her, don't you.": "",
  "But I must ask, do you have enough money to foot the bill?": "",
  "(Money, right. I need to pay for things. 50,000 yen would be nice right about now.)": "",
  "(I don't have that much on me. What else is new?)": "",
  "Sorry, I'll swing by another time.": "",
  "Understood. We hope to see you again soon.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you're back! And you requested me?": "",
  "Of course, who else would I choose?": "",
  "Hehe. Out of all the girls here, you ended up picking me. That... makes me really happy.": "",
  "(It's nice to know that doing this will help put an honest person through school.)": "",
  "W-Wuh... No more...": "",
  "Oh my. Looks like we overdid it, huh?": "",
  "(I'll come back when I'm not already stumbling drunk...)": "",
  "(All right. These drinks are nothing to me!)": "",
  "Pour me one of those ass-kicking drinks, Madoka-chan.": "",
  "Coming right up!": "",
  "I can tell this is top-shelf. A taste that matches the price.": "",
  "All right, hit me with one more.": "",
  "Will you really be okay? Your face is all red.": "",
  "Aha, ahaha! I can... still... keep going. The drink, if you please.": "",
  "(Ugh. I know I'm a mess right now... But I guess I've been through worse.)": "",
  "You sure can hold your alcohol, Yagami-san. It's like you were built for drinking.": "",
  "By the way. How's the whole tuition thing going?": "",
  "Oh, good! I've been making all my payments and then some.": "",
  "Awesome. That's great to hear.": "",
  "Wait a sec...": "",
  "Are you... ordering all these drinks to help me?": "",
  "Huh? Why would you think that?": "",
  "Well, you never do anything perverted. In fact, all you ever do is order a bunch of alcohol...": "",
  "And you're worried about my tuition on top of that...": "",
  "Maybe you're just imagining things?": "",
  "So. Here's how Apple Pie works. Whenever someone requests you or racks up a huge bill, you get a cut of the profit.": "",
  "Let's be upfront with each other, Yagami-san. You're helping me a lot, and I want to know the reason.": "",
  "What can I say, other than \"happy to be of service\"?": "",
  "Uh-huh. Well. I'm gonna need to return the favor somehow.": "",
  "All I really want is for you to relax and enjoy yourself on the job. Don't need much more than that.": "",
  "...Lie down and close your eyes. When I say I'm returning a favor, I mean it.": "",
  "I can't stand the idea of you ordering drinks all the time without letting me give you some kind of service!": "",
  "I... I don't think this is a good idea!": "",
  "I wasn't asking what you think! This is happening whether you like it or not, Yagami-san. Might as well accept it.": "",
  "Well... if you put it like that, then... I guess I have no choice.": "",
  "(All right. They say life is to be experienced, so...)": "",
  "I'm ready if you are.": "",
  "My goodness! Yagami-san, you're as stiff as a stone!": "",
  "Ohh... Well, when you touch me like that, I am...": "",
  "W-Wow... And now you're twitching? Hehe, look at you go!": "",
  "Oh. Oooh! There, that's it, right there! You really know how to work it out...": "",
  "I can hardly believe how knotted up your shoulders were... Your back, too. No wonder you were moaning like that!": "",
  "Yeah. And thanks to you, I'll be sleeping like a baby tonight.": "",
  "(Well, that was unexpected...)": "",
  "(...But in an entirely pleasant way. I needed that.)": "",
  "Yes, I needed to tell you something...": "",
  "(What could it possibly be?)": "",
  "Oh, you came in at the wrong time. She's on break right now.": "",
  "Ah. Well, okay then. I'll come back when she's in.": "",
  "Madoka-chan, what did you want to tell me?": "",
  "Yes, that. So, I'm going to be leaving the club. Permanently.": "",
  "What, no way!": "",
  "(...Well, I actually knew because Yosuke-kun told me.)": "",
  "I managed to save up enough to completely cover my tuition. I'm a free girl now.": "",
  "It's all thanks to you, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Good for you, Madoka! You're taking control of your life, and you've got a sexy li'l sugar daddy to boot!": "",
  "Hey, it's nothing like that!": "",
  "But thanks to him, you're finally going to graduate and get yourself a nice career. You're one lucky lady, you know?": "",
  "That's true... This has been a blessing in disguise.": "",
  "Make sure to do your best, okay?": "",
  "I could've sworn I saw this guy I knew from high school...  He was an underclassman... who I was rather fond of.": "",
  "But there's no way that was him. Must've just been in my head.": "",
  "Could be.": "",
  "(Well done, Yosuke-kun. Thanks to you, the apple of your eye made it out of Apple Pie.)": "",
  "Thanks to you, yeah. I take it you're familiar with those punks?": "",
  "Damn. Well that doesn't sound very pleasant.": "",
  "See, I knew you could pay up. I'll be taking back my money now.": "",
  "You could say that... For one reason or another, they seem to have a grudge against me.": "",
  "Now that that's settled... Looks like we haven't introduced ourselves, have we?": "",
  "I guess not. I'm Takayuki Yagami, and I work as a detective here in Kamurocho.": "",
  "A detective, you say... Interesting.": "",
  "And you were trying to collect from the Keihin Gang of all people?": "",
  "When it comes to being a nuisance, they're right up there with the yakuza.": "",
  "I'm Kazufumi Kamaguchi, and I run Turtle Financing on the third floor of this building.": "",
  "Leaders... such as?": "",
  "Wait, you lent money to <font_kind=yakuza_italic>them</font_kind>? Man... you really need to be more careful who you trust.": "",
  "In other words, I'm a debt collector.": "",
  "Well, that is one part of the job.": "",
  "Yeah. Should've known they never planned on paying me back. This isn't the first time they attacked me, either.": "",
  "Don't you get smart with me! How about showing us some respect, huh?": "",
  "Respect? For swindling me out of my money? I'll respect you when you pay back what you owe. Wouldn't that be more fair?": "",
  "Psh. You think the Keihin Gang's just gonna bend over backwards and pay you out the ass, huh?": "",
  "(Again with these Keihin Gang lunatics... They just cause problems wherever they go, don't they?)": "",
  "(Well, I'd better not get wrapped up in this.)": "",
  "(I can't just let this go. Time for me to step in.)": "",
  "Oh, you're... What are you doing here?": "",
  "You not only refuse to pay your debt, but you'd even assault your lender? Didn't know you punks could stoop so low.": "",
  "Aww, you feelin' sorry for the guy? Then why don't I just punish you in his place!": "",
  "Ngh... Hope you choke on it, you bastard...": "",
  "Lowlife bastards... They think they can do whatever the hell they want. Unforgivable.": "",
  "I should let you know, though, those goons weren't the only ones I lent money to.": "",
  "...I actually ended up financing a couple of their leaders, too.": "",
  "Kenta Kasai and Renji Honda. They owe me 800,000 yen. <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Each</font_kind>.": "",
  "Yeah, no kidding... Say, Yagami-san. You're good at tracking people down, yes? Being that you're a detective and all.": "",
  "And from what I've seen, you can handle yourself in a scuffle to boot.": "",
  "Could you track down those two imbeciles for me and get my money back?": "",
  "Huh? You really want <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind> to do it?": "",
  "Yeah. I'll pay you for it, of course.": "",
  "Hmm... I am always running into them, one way or another.": "",
  "All right. I think I can accept your case.": "",
  "Great. You'd be doing me quite a favor.": "",
  "(This is the Keihin Gang we're talking about... Even when I ignore them, they butt into my life.)": "",
  "(Guess I'll just have to drag them over to Kamaguchi-san whenever I see their ugly mugs.)": "",
  "Oh, would you look at the time... I'd better be getting back to the office. See ya!": "",
  "Aw crap...": "",
  "Should've asked him about Yakumaru Loans... ": "",
  "(Turtle Financing, right? Maybe I can catch up to him.)": "",
  "This is all the money they owe you, right?": "",
  "Yessir. You really handled your business out there.": "",
  "Next time you're short on cash, you come talk to Kamaguchi and I'll lend you whatever you need.": "",
  "My interest rates are low, and you can pay me back real slow. That's why they call me the Turtle Man.": "",
  "Hm. That doesn't sound too bad. Sort of.": "",
  "However, when it comes time to collect, I tend to get aggressive. Guess I'm more like a snapping turtle!": "",
  "In that case, I'll make sure not to borrow anything in the first place.": "",
  "Hey, take it from me. You're better off not getting into debt in the first place.": "",
  "However, what I might need your help with is gathering information.": "",
  "You seem like you know your way around town. I could use a reference like you for some of the cases I handle.": "",
  "Sure. You just let me know the particulars and I'll see what I can do. I'll get the rest of the staff to help out too.": "",
  "Thanks, you'd be doing me a solid there.": "",
  "So, you'll look into Yakumaru Loans like you said?": "",
  "Of course. The Turtle always keeps his word.": "",
  "All right, we're here.": "",
  "Don't push me, you shithead!": "",
  "Well, if it isn't Kasai himself. You actually caught the guy.": "",
  "Yep.": "",
  "Mind explaining what the hell we're doing here, Yagami!?": "",
  "Not at all. You owe Turtle Financing 800 grand, remember?": "",
  "This gentleman here got so tired of waiting, he asked me to collect for him. Even turtles can't wait forever.": "",
  "What, so you're his lapdog now? How pathetic!": "",
  "Kasai. We already know you have the money. I'm surprised you haven't blown it at every high-end soapland in town by now.": "",
  "You think you got me figured out, huh... Well, what if I just said \"fuck it\" to paying back the money?": "",
  "So that's how it's gonna be? Then I guess we'll need to pay a very special visit to a very special place.": "",
  "Wait, where do you think you're taking me!?": "",
  "The courtroom, of course. Oh, wait, you didn't know I was a certified lawyer?": "",
  "Here, check out this badge. Hot shit, right?": "",
  "You're actually a goddamn lawyer!? Geez, what don't you do...": "",
  "Apparently a lot less than you. Debt evasion's probably just the tip of the iceberg for a leader of the Keihin Gang.": "",
  "You heard me. With a record like yours, you'll be out of the courtroom and behind bars so fast it'll make your head spin.": "",
  "No! Wait... Don't do this to me! All I need to do is pay, right? ": "",
  "Wow, Yagami-san, you practically had him begging for mercy there. That alone is almost worth paying for!": "",
  "Ah, they've been getting on my nerves as it is. You didn't need to give me anything.": "",
  "Well, I just wanted to show you my appreciation, so. Take it anyway.": "",
  "In that case, I'll take you up on your offer.": "",
  "Now then. The only one left is Honda, and I hear he's pretty tough to take down. Watch yourself.": "",
  "Move your feet, Honda!": "",
  "Oww! Okay, okay, I'm going! No need to shove!": "",
  "Well, if it isn't Honda. Dragged in like the mutt he is.": "",
  "Actually, he was pretty calm about the whole thing... after I whooped his ass.": "",
  "Hey. Yagami-san. What is this place?": "",
  "800,000 yen, wasn't it? That's how much you owe Turtle Financing, so stop playing dumb and pay up already.": "",
  "Ugh. Is that what you wanted to talk to me about?": "",
  "Damn straight it is.": "",
  "Fine, I'll tell you what.": "",
  "You and me. Another battle. You win, I give back the money. I win, I walk outta here free. How's that sound?": "",
  "Heh, fine by me. That is, as long as the battle's in the courtroom. You'll be the defendant.": "",
  "What's this court talk all of a sudden?": "",
  "So, I happen to be a certified lawyer who specializes in \"courtroom battles.\" You still wanna go through with this?": "",
  "...Well, shit. Take your goddamn money then!": "",
  "Thanks for all your help, Yagami-san. Here's for all your trouble.": "",
  "Sure thing. I'm just amazed you were able to pull it off. Honda's no pushover, let me tell you.": "",
  "I mean, we even sent out ten of our very best men, and he took them all down in no time flat.": "",
  "Well, what can I say? Think twice before lending money to guys with that kind of rep.": "",
  "Yeah... Looks like The Turtle learned his lesson.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I need to collect money from Kasai and Honda. I'm counting on you.": "",
  "Yagami-san, the only one left is Kasai. I'm counting on you.": "",
  "I'm telling you, the ladies are all over me! They just can't get enough of the D... for Deguchi, that is.": "",
  "More like D for Delusional. Now beat it, you're bothering the other guests. Not to mention wasting my time.": "",
  "(Wait, is that Seiya talking to... Deguchi-san? He was supposed to be working on a tuna boat.)": "",
  "Uh-oh! Yagami-san!?": "",
  "Hey. Deguchi-san. Aren't you supposed to be somewhere right now? You know, like, the middle of the ocean?": "",
  "Well, that <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> my intention...": "",
  "But I realized something. That no matter how hard I try, I still wanna be the number one host in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Plus, boats make me queasy in the first place, so I busted a mission back here as quickly as I could!": "",
  "And does Taniyama-san know about your decision?": "",
  "Nope, haven't said a word to Aunt Fumie. She'd probably have an ulcer if she found out.": "",
  "So you ran away without telling anyone because you didn't want to do the work.": "",
  "Speaking of which, I made the mistake of hiring this dumbo after listening to all his bragging and boasting...": "",
  "...Only to watch him walk out on the very first day because cleaning toilets \"wasn't part of the job description.\"": "",
  "Yeah! It wasn't! And besides... I had no idea I'd get fired over it.": "",
  "Deguchi-san. You really should have thought about your aunt before doing all this.": "",
  "How much have you paid her back since we last talked? I'm guessing not a single yen.": "",
  "W-Well, if this host thing pans out the way it should, I'll be able to get her back everything in no time!": "",
  "But how can you expect to be a host if you can't last a day on the job?": "",
  "That only happened because my talent was left unrecognized! Seriously, they don't know what they're missing here!": "",
  "...Okay, I've heard enough. You think you deserve another chance to work here? Then you're gonna need to prove it.": "",
  "Ooh! Does this mean I get my job back?": "",
  "That would only reinforce your habit of blustering through life, so no.": "",
  "Instead, I want to see how good you are at getting a girl's attention.": "",
  "What? You mean, like, throwing out random pick-up lines?": "",
  "No, I'm talking about being comfortable around women and finessing the conversation. That's how we make our living.": "",
  "Oh, well I've talked to plenty of women before... Let's see, my aunt's a woman, so's my cousin...": "",
  "All right, I've come up with the perfect skills assessment for you.": "",
  "You and Yagami-san will face off in a contest of flirting. If you win, I'll see if I can get you rehired.": "",
  "Wait, why do I have to be involved?": "",
  "First off, I'm too busy to watch him myself. And second, isn't he part of some case you're working on?": "",
  "That means he's your responsibility. Besides, he'll probably learn his lesson if he loses to an amateur like you.": "",
  "I understand your logic, but I'm not his guardian.": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san? Will you help me out? Otherwise, my future will be drowning in tuna, and not the kind that hosts want!": "",
  "(A flirting contest with Deguchi-san, huh? Should I even bother?)": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm pretty busy myself.": "",
  "Wait! Have mercy!": "",
  "...You heard the man. Now get going.": "",
  "I'm not going anywhere until you give me another chance!": "",
  "You really like making a fool of yourself, don't you...": "",
  "(Oh boy.)": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! Have you decided to face me after all?": "",
  "Yes, but only because I feel bad for Seiya.": "",
  "I knew you were on my side! Aw, you have no idea how happy I am right now!  ": "",
  "So, what do we need to do for this flirting contest of yours?": "",
  "Okay. Basically, you need to flirt with a girl based on my criteria of choice. And after you make first contact...": "",
  "Take a cute picture with her before reporting back to me. Oh, and make sure you explain this contest to her, too.": "",
  "That sure is asking a lot from a complete stranger.": "",
  "Hah, any host who wants to work at Stardust should be able to do this half asleep!": "",
  "But I don't even plan on being a host...": "",
  "I'll do it, Seiya-san! Just tell me who to ask!": "",
  "Okay, how about... You find a girl wearing white, and Yagami-san, you find a girl wearing red.": "",
  "The first one back with a picture wins the contest.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Wait a sec...": "เดี๋ยวนะ...",
  "What, no way!": "หา ไม่จริงน่า!",
  "Yep.": "อือ"
 }
}
